{"id":"n42909-2-10","stage":4,"title":"노출 · 曝光","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42909-2-10-1","ko":"빛이 너무 밝은 것 같은데?","zh":"光线好像太亮了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"빛이","meaning":"光，光线","explanation":"빛：光，光线；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"빛","audio":"/audio/bcfe8128a79515eee12a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62079","senseId":"1","lemma":"빛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빛이","audio":"/audio/c68adcdf92b4f013d4ea.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"밝은","meaning":"明亮","explanation":"밝다：明亮；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"밝다","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62105","senseId":"2","lemma":"밝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밝은","audio":"/audio/123e1f17f568b27b5461.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데","audio":"/audio/09d1b4825a769d691604.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bcfe8128a79515ee","term":"빛","zh":"光，光线","audio":"/audio/bcfe8128a79515eee12a.mp3","entryId":"62079","definition":"从太阳、月亮、电灯、火等处散发出来，照亮事物的东西。","pronunciation":["빋"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"e97bef4d1c5d4c2f","term":"밝다","zh":"明亮","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3","entryId":"62105","definition":"某个场所光线充足而十分亮堂。","pronunciation":["박따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8c92d4a54dd2c2988f78.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n42909-2-10-2","ko":"노출을 좀 줄여서 사진을 찍어야겠다.","zh":"得把曝光调低一点再拍照。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"노출을","meaning":"曝光","explanation":"노출：曝光；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"노출","audio":"/audio/a1f2cd11ea3b688377da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42909","senseId":"2","lemma":"노출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노출을","audio":"/audio/02144f12c0f5486f4f3d.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"줄여서","meaning":"减少，缩少，缩减","explanation":"줄이다：减少，缩少，缩减；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"줄이다","audio":"/audio/cd093d6c487c80cfcc0c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62102","senseId":"2","lemma":"줄이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄여서","audio":"/audio/9ef19a78342363a8b1dd.mp3"}},{"text":"사진을","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진을","audio":"/audio/3394e235d3ed53a58eaf.mp3"}},{"text":"찍어야겠다.","meaning":"拍，拍摄","explanation":"찍다：拍，拍摄；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"찍다","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63320","senseId":"6","lemma":"찍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찍어야겠다","audio":"/audio/0fe005144e7fccaca117.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a1f2cd11ea3b6883","term":"노출","zh":"曝光","audio":"/audio/a1f2cd11ea3b688377da.mp3","entryId":"42909","definition":"照相时打开快门，使光线照射进来。","pronunciation":["노출"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"cd093d6c487c80cf","term":"줄이다","zh":"减少，缩少，缩减","audio":"/audio/cd093d6c487c80cfcc0c.mp3","entryId":"62102","definition":"使数或量变得比原来少。","pronunciation":["주리다"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"e1e4a89817058245","term":"찍다","zh":"拍，拍摄","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3","entryId":"63320","definition":"用照相机照射某个物品，把其样子移动到胶片上。","pronunciation":["찍따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7a22f518a94d33fc3485.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.69,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=42909","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":132,"sequenceScore":2.5167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["得把曝光调低一点再拍照。","事故现场的情况怎么样？","光线好像太亮了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["得把曝光调低一点再拍照。","光线好像太亮了？","事故现场的情况怎么样？"],"answer":0}]}
